{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05855","headline":"送宇文太守赴宣城 · 王维","name":"送宇文太守赴宣城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥落云外山，迢递舟中赏。\n铙吹发西江，秋空多清响。\n地迥古城芜，月明寒潮广。\n时赛敬亭神，复解罟师网。\n何处寄相思？南风吹五两。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}